**II.2**. in Egypt, **select by** ἐπίκρισις 11 {{Refs 2nd c.AD+|(which see), “PGen.” 19 (2nd c.AD)}}:—_passive_, {{Refs 1st c.AD+|“POxy.” 39 (1st c.AD).}}
**II.3**. **consider**, πάντα ταῦτα 1st c.BC: Philodemus Philosophus “περὶ οἰκονομίας” p.63J.
