**III.6**. **attempt**, πράξεων μεγάλων 1st-2nd c.AD: Plutarchus Biographus et Philosophus “Marius” 7.
**III.6.b**. with _infinitive_, **undertake**, γεωργεῖν {{Refs|“IG” 7.2446 (from Thebes).}}
